    "bbox": [
      55.65,
      328.69,
      532.0,
      364.24
    ],
    "text": "FILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE ALAWWA PRADESHIYA SABHAUNDER SECTION 66A(1)(a) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      377.17,
      452.88,
      388.24
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the office of member of Alawwa Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of death ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      401.17,
      539.97,
      460.24
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna, the recognized political party to whichPatabandi Wasam Baduge Gamini Wijayananda Senadheera the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66A(1)(a)of the aforesaid Ordinance, to decide upon the member of that 4 - Nungamuwa if Alawwa Pradeshiya Sabha who belongs tosuch party and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declaredelected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      473.17,
      539.92,
      496.24
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Karuna Hewage Chaminda Weerawansha to fill such vacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      509.17,
      539.92,
      544.24
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE I, Gamalathge Dilip Nishantha, returning officer of the Alawwa Pradeshiya Sabha, acting interms of Section 66A(1)(a) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that KarunaHewage Chaminda Weerawansha was elected as the member of the 4 - Nungamuwa of Alawwa Pradeshiya Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      401.49,
      569.17,
      528.19,
      604.24
    ],
    "text": "GAMALATHGE DILIP NISHANTHA,Returning Officer,Alawwa Pradeshiya Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
